.\" Man page for install(1) — ArchinstallSuper entrypoint
.TH INSTALL 1 "2026-11-26" "ArchinstallSuper 0.11.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
install \- ArchinstallSuper interactive UEFI installer entrypoint
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B install.sh
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B install.sh
is the entrypoint for ArchinstallSuper, a standalone UEFI installer for
Arch Linux. It parses command-line arguments, sources the library modules in
\fBlib/\fR and drives the installation workflow.

Without options it starts the interactive full-screen TUI installer.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB--check\fR
Run preflight validation only (UEFI, live ISO, network).

.TP
\fB--dry-run\fR
Collect settings, show the plan and validate packages, but do not modify any
disk.

.TP
\fB--plain\fR
Do not use the full-screen TUI; run in plain text mode.

.TP
\fB--debug\fR
Enable verbose debug output in the log.

.TP
\fB--log\fR \fIFILE\fR
Write the installation log to \fIFILE\fR.

.TP
\fB--config\fR \fIFILE\fR
Use \fIFILE\fR as an unattended installation configuration file.

.TP
\fB--auto\fR
Run unattended installation (requires \fB--config\fR). No UI is shown.

.TP
\fB--example-config\fR
Print a sample configuration file to stdout and exit.

.TP
\fB--version\fR,\ \fB-V\fR
Print version and exit.

.TP
\fB--help\fR,\ \fB-h\fR
Show usage information and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI/var/log/archinstallsuper.log\fR
Installation log.
.TP
\fI/run/archinstallsuper/installer.lock\fR
Single-instance lock.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR archinstallsuper (8),\ pacstrap (8)
.SH BUGS
Report issues at <https://github.com/mashituladi-star/ArchinstallSuper/issues>.
